[00:00.00] 作词 : 子健
[00:01.00] 作曲 : 子健
[00:02.00] 编曲 : 刺猬/陆希文
[00:03.00] 制作人 : 陆希文
[00:18.71]感受 不到了 流逝的时间
[00:23.27]阴森的地牢里 漆黑一片
[00:28.12]已经靠猫粮 充饥了很多天
[00:32.86]绝望的哭喊声 近声嘶力竭
[00:37.66]禽兽的恶影 闪烁门隙间
[00:42.51]脚步一声声 战栗回旋
[00:47.49]残暴施虐 无数次又一夜
[00:52.30]最终饿死时 仍脚铐铁链
[00:57.51]the dead man is alive
[01:02.34]the dead girls were aware
[01:07.27]a mad animal's desire
[01:11.40]can be never fully fueled
[01:16.52]sometime you die
[01:20.71]could be happier than you're alive
[01:25.43]sometime you're alive
[01:30.19]just much worse than you were dead
[01:54.14]when the 2 girls were being killed
[01:58.65]they were only 8 years old
[02:03.44]it brings me back to the dark memories
[02:08.71]something i'll never forget anything details
[02:13.24]i’m not like someone else
[02:17.69]i lived through my own hell
[02:22.49]i thought i was well prepared
[02:27.25]but how did it come to this now
[03:09.09]still i am falling in dreams
[03:18.40]i am calling in the winds
[03:26.97]they say i was strange
[03:31.23]they think i was insane
[03:35.93]who cares what they think
[03:39.45]i’ll become a ghost forever singing in the winds
[03:51.45]大提琴：李成
[03:52.45]大提琴录音：野口西西
[03:53.45]录音/混音：陆希文
